[{"id":"aghna-77-31-3","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"koristi","en":"he/it avails"},{"bs":"koriste","en":"they avail"},{"bs":"koristim","en":"I avail"},{"bs":"koristio je","en":"he/it availed"}],"ref":"77:31","answerWord":"يُغْنِى","answerSound":"audio/1c176ac6df88164558a4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Which yet is) no relief nor shelter from the flame.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["لَّا","ظَلِيلٍ","وَلَا","يُغْنِى","مِنَ","ٱللَّهَبِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"aghna-7-48-8","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"koristio je","en":"he/it availed"},{"bs":"obogaćuje","en":"he/it enriches"},{"bs":"obogaćuje ih","en":"he/it enriches them"},{"bs":"koriste","en":"they avail"}],"ref":"7:48","answerWord":"أَغْنَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/b4c64fddf9e967bb3739.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the dwellers on the Heights call unto men whom they know by their marks, (saying): What did your multitude and that in which ye took your pride avail you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["وَنَادَىٰٓ","أَصْحَٰبُ","ٱلْأَعْرَافِ","رِجَالًا","يَعْرِفُونَهُم","بِسِيمَىٰهُمْ","قَالُوا۟","مَآ","أَغْنَىٰ","عَنكُمْ","جَمْعُكُمْ","وَمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَسْتَكْبِرُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"aghna-4-130-2","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"obogaćuje","en":"he/it enriches"},{"bs":"pa te je obogatio","en":"and He made [you] rich"},{"bs":"obogaćuje ih","en":"he/it enriches them"},{"bs":"obogaćuje vas","en":"he/it enriches you (all)"}],"ref":"4:130","answerWord":"يُغْنِ","answerSound":"audio/25323a61b568975fc907.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But if they separate, Allah will compensate each out of His abundance. Allah is ever All-Embracing, All-Knowing.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["وَإِن","يَتَفَرَّقَا","يُغْنِ","ٱللَّهُ","كُلًّا","مِّن","سَعَتِهِۦ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَٰسِعًا","حَكِيمًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"aghna-9-28-17","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"obogaćuje vas","en":"he/it enriches you (all)"},{"bs":"koristio je","en":"he/it availed"},{"bs":"zaokuplja ga","en":"he/it occupies him"},{"bs":"koristi","en":"he/it avails"}],"ref":"9:28","answerWord":"يُغْنِيكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/36eca4cf2da46cc11349.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! The idolaters only are unclean. So let them not come near the Inviolable Place of Worship after this their year. If ye fear poverty (from the loss of their merchandise) Allah shall preserve you of His bounty if He will. Lo! Allah is Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِنَّمَا","ٱلْمُشْرِكُونَ","نَجَسٌ","فَلَا","يَقْرَبُوا۟","ٱلْمَسْجِدَ","ٱلْحَرَامَ","بَعْدَ","عَامِهِمْ","هَٰذَا","وَإِنْ","خِفْتُمْ","عَيْلَةً","فَسَوْفَ","يُغْنِيكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦٓ","إِن","شَآءَ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلِيمٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"aghna-11-101-6","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"koristila je","en":"she/it availed"},{"bs":"obogaćuje ih","en":"he/it enriches them"},{"bs":"obogaćuje vas","en":"he/it enriches you (all)"},{"bs":"obogaćuje","en":"he/it enriches"}],"ref":"11:101","answerWord":"أَغْنَتْ","answerSound":"audio/ea269232d07bfd11af42.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We wronged them not, but they did wrong themselves; and their gods on whom they call beside Allah availed them naught when came thy Lord's command; they added to them naught save ruin.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["وَمَا","ظَلَمْنَٰهُمْ","وَلَٰكِن","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","فَمَآ","أَغْنَتْ","عَنْهُمْ","ءَالِهَتُهُمُ","ٱلَّتِى","يَدْعُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","مِن","شَىْءٍ","لَّمَّا","جَآءَ","أَمْرُ","رَبِّكَ","وَمَا","زَادُوهُمْ","غَيْرَ","تَتْبِيبٍ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"aghna-24-32-10","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"obogaćuje ih","en":"he/it enriches them"},{"bs":"koriste","en":"they avail"},{"bs":"obogaćuje vas","en":"he/it enriches you (all)"},{"bs":"koristi","en":"he/it avails"}],"ref":"24:32","answerWord":"يُغْنِهِمُ","answerSound":"audio/26ca4b4b271b78adae2b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And marry such of you as are solitary and the pious of your slaves and maid-servants. If they be poor, Allah will enrich them of His bounty. Allah is of ample means, Aware.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["وَأَنكِحُوا۟","ٱلْأَيَٰمَىٰ","مِنكُمْ","وَٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ","مِنْ","عِبَادِكُمْ","وَإِمَآئِكُمْ","إِن","يَكُونُوا۟","فُقَرَآءَ","يُغْنِهِمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦ","وَٱللَّهُ","وَٰسِعٌ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"aghna-45-19-2","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"koriste","en":"they avail"},{"bs":"obogaćuje ih","en":"he/it enriches them"},{"bs":"koristim","en":"I avail"},{"bs":"koristila je","en":"she/it availed"}],"ref":"45:19","answerWord":"يُغْنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/efe5c912f7cfa01eaaad.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! they can avail thee naught against Allah. And lo! as for the wrong-doers, some of them are friends of others; and Allah is the Friend of those who ward off (evil).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["إِنَّهُمْ","لَن","يُغْنُوا۟","عَنكَ","مِنَ","ٱللَّهِ","شَيْـًٔا","وَإِنَّ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ","بَعْضُهُمْ","أَوْلِيَآءُ","بَعْضٍ","وَٱللَّهُ","وَلِىُّ","ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"aghna-80-37-5","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"zaokuplja ga","en":"he/it occupies him"},{"bs":"koristim","en":"I avail"},{"bs":"obogaćuje ih","en":"he/it enriches them"},{"bs":"pa te je obogatio","en":"and He made [you] rich"}],"ref":"80:37","answerWord":"يُغْنِيهِ","answerSound":"audio/2b0b07c7087a7a820abf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Every man that day will have concern enough to make him heedless (of others).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["لِكُلِّ","ٱمْرِئٍ","مِّنْهُمْ","يَوْمَئِذٍ","شَأْنٌ","يُغْنِيهِ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"aghna-93-8-2","words":["verb:aghna"],"options":[{"bs":"pa te je obogatio","en":"and He made [you] rich"},{"bs":"koriste","en":"they (two) avail"},{"bs":"obogaćuje ih","en":"he/it enriches them"},{"bs":"koristim","en":"I avail"}],"ref":"93:8","answerWord":"فَأَغْنَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/6a0362a354ce69433152.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Did He not find thee destitute and enrich (thee)?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"koristiti, pomoći, obogatiti","en":"to avail, to suffice, to enrich"},"passage":["وَوَجَدَكَ","عَآئِلًا","فَأَغْنَىٰ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْنَى"}},{"id":"akhkhara-14-42-8","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"odgađa ih","en":"he/it delays them"},{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"},{"bs":"i odgodio je","en":"and he/it delayed"},{"bs":"i odgađa vas","en":"and he/it delays you (all)"}],"ref":"14:42","answerWord":"يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e67762cd2bf1dfd83c9c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Deem not that Allah is unaware of what the wicked do. He but giveth them a respite till a day when eyes will stare (in terror),","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَحْسَبَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَٰفِلًا","عَمَّا","يَعْمَلُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ","إِنَّمَا","يُؤَخِّرُهُمْ","لِيَوْمٍ","تَشْخَصُ","فِيهِ","ٱلْأَبْصَٰرُ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-11-8-1","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"odgodili smo","en":"we delayed"},{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"},{"bs":"i odgađa vas","en":"and he/it delays you (all)"},{"bs":"biva odgođen","en":"he/it is delayed"}],"ref":"11:8","answerWord":"أَخَّرْنَا","answerSound":"audio/c835febd4ebd256cad2a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if We delay for them the doom until a reckoned time, they will surely say: What withholdeth it? Verily on the day when it cometh unto them, it cannot be averted from them, and that which they derided will surround them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["وَلَئِنْ","أَخَّرْنَا","عَنْهُمُ","ٱلْعَذَابَ","إِلَىٰٓ","أُمَّةٍ","مَّعْدُودَةٍ","لَّيَقُولُنَّ","مَا","يَحْبِسُهُۥٓ","أَلَا","يَوْمَ","يَأْتِيهِمْ","لَيْسَ","مَصْرُوفًا","عَنْهُمْ","وَحَاقَ","بِهِم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","بِهِۦ","يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-11-104-1","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"odgađamo ga","en":"We delay it"},{"bs":"odgodili smo","en":"we delayed"},{"bs":"i šta je ostavila","en":"and it held back"},{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"}],"ref":"11:104","answerWord":"نُؤَخِّرُهُۥٓ","answerSound":"audio/46942c783104e525eeb9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We defer it only to a term already reckoned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["وَمَا","نُؤَخِّرُهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","لِأَجَلٍ","مَّعْدُودٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-14-44-9","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"odgodi nas!","en":"delay us!"},{"bs":"odgađamo ga","en":"We delay it"},{"bs":"i odgađa vas","en":"and he/it delays you (all)"},{"bs":"i odgodio je","en":"and he/it delayed"}],"ref":"14:44","answerWord":"أَخِّرْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/9bdf2871d64d91033125.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And warn mankind of a day when the doom will come upon them, and those who did wrong will say: Our Lord! Reprieve us for a little while. We will obey Thy call and will follow the messengers. (It will be answered): Did ye not swear before that there would be no end for you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["وَأَنذِرِ","ٱلنَّاسَ","يَوْمَ","يَأْتِيهِمُ","ٱلْعَذَابُ","فَيَقُولُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوا۟","رَبَّنَآ","أَخِّرْنَآ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","قَرِيبٍ","نُّجِبْ","دَعْوَتَكَ","وَنَتَّبِعِ","ٱلرُّسُلَ","أَوَلَمْ","تَكُونُوٓا۟","أَقْسَمْتُم","مِّن","قَبْلُ","مَا","لَكُم","مِّن","زَوَالٍ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-17-62-7","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"},{"bs":"i odgađa vas","en":"and he/it delays you (all)"},{"bs":"odgađa","en":"he/it delays"},{"bs":"i odgodio je","en":"and he/it delayed"}],"ref":"17:62","answerWord":"أَخَّرْتَنِ","answerSound":"audio/95fc7a0c2429e4f68272.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Seest Thou this (creature) whom Thou hast honoured above me, if Thou give me grace until the Day of Resurrection I verily will seize his seed, save but a few.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَرَءَيْتَكَ","هَٰذَا","ٱلَّذِى","كَرَّمْتَ","عَلَىَّ","لَئِنْ","أَخَّرْتَنِ","إِلَىٰ","يَوْمِ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","لَأَحْتَنِكَنَّ","ذُرِّيَّتَهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-63-10-13","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"},{"bs":"odgodili smo","en":"we delayed"},{"bs":"odgodio si nas","en":"you delayed us"},{"bs":"i odgađa vas","en":"and he/it delays you (all)"}],"ref":"63:10","answerWord":"أَخَّرْتَنِىٓ","answerSound":"audio/60a05ca2edd7448898ce.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And spend of that wherewith We have provided you before death cometh unto one of you and he saith: My Lord! If only thou wouldst reprieve me for a little while, then I would give alms and be among the righteous.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["وَأَنفِقُوا۟","مِن","مَّا","رَزَقْنَٰكُم","مِّن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يَأْتِىَ","أَحَدَكُمُ","ٱلْمَوْتُ","فَيَقُولَ","رَبِّ","لَوْلَآ","أَخَّرْتَنِىٓ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","قَرِيبٍ","فَأَصَّدَّقَ","وَأَكُن","مِّنَ","ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-63-11-1","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"odgađa","en":"he/it delays"},{"bs":"odgodili smo","en":"we delayed"},{"bs":"i odgađa vas","en":"and he/it delays you (all)"},{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"}],"ref":"63:11","answerWord":"يُؤَخِّرَ","answerSound":"audio/5c48c9e9917f635e20f8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But Allah reprieveth no soul when its term cometh, and Allah is Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["وَلَن","يُؤَخِّرَ","ٱللَّهُ","نَفْسًا","إِذَا","جَآءَ","أَجَلُهَا","وَٱللَّهُ","خَبِيرٌۢ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-71-4-4","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i odgađa vas","en":"and he/it delays you (all)"},{"bs":"odgodi nas!","en":"delay us!"},{"bs":"biva odgođen","en":"he/it is delayed"},{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"}],"ref":"71:4","answerWord":"وَيُؤَخِّرْكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/f6c6c0a86b96367be0f8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That He may forgive you somewhat of your sins and respite you to an appointed term. Lo! the term of Allah, when it cometh, cannot be delayed, if ye but knew.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["يَغْفِرْ","لَكُم","مِّن","ذُنُوبِكُمْ","وَيُؤَخِّرْكُمْ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","مُّسَمًّى","إِنَّ","أَجَلَ","ٱللَّهِ","إِذَا","جَآءَ","لَا","يُؤَخَّرُ","لَوْ","كُنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-71-4-14","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"biva odgođen","en":"he/it is delayed"},{"bs":"i šta je ostavila","en":"and it held back"},{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"},{"bs":"i odgađa vas","en":"and he/it delays you (all)"}],"ref":"71:4","answerWord":"يُؤَخَّرُ","answerSound":"audio/4adc70bad29cc118a2a5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That He may forgive you somewhat of your sins and respite you to an appointed term. Lo! the term of Allah, when it cometh, cannot be delayed, if ye but knew.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["يَغْفِرْ","لَكُم","مِّن","ذُنُوبِكُمْ","وَيُؤَخِّرْكُمْ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","مُّسَمًّى","إِنَّ","أَجَلَ","ٱللَّهِ","إِذَا","جَآءَ","لَا","يُؤَخَّرُ","لَوْ","كُنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-75-13-5","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i odgodio je","en":"and he/it delayed"},{"bs":"odgodio si nas","en":"you delayed us"},{"bs":"i šta je ostavila","en":"and it held back"},{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"}],"ref":"75:13","answerWord":"وَأَخَّرَ","answerSound":"audio/8a6e136a2a1a7ff07a00.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On that day man is told the tale of that which he hath sent before and left behind.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["يُنَبَّؤُا۟","ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ","يَوْمَئِذٍۭ","بِمَا","قَدَّمَ","وَأَخَّرَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}},{"id":"akhkhara-82-5-4","words":["verb:akhkhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i šta je ostavila","en":"and it held back"},{"bs":"odgodio si me","en":"you delayed me"},{"bs":"odgađa","en":"he/it delays"},{"bs":"odgodili smo","en":"we delayed"}],"ref":"82:5","answerWord":"وَأَخَّرَتْ","answerSound":"audio/1a0a323a4b50090c6a78.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"A soul will know what it hath sent before (it) and what left behind.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgoditi, odložiti","en":"to delay, to postpone"},"passage":["عَلِمَتْ","نَفْسٌ","مَّا","قَدَّمَتْ","وَأَخَّرَتْ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَخَّرَ"}}]